The card behaves like a game HUD: the BOTTOM bar and the two floating TOP icons (menu + share) are PERMANENTLY VISIBLE, statically pinned at the top and bottom of the card viewport, and NEVER scroll away or disappear — no matter how far the user scrolls the card body between them.

Think of it as the GTA HUD: the radar/minimap and stats stay glued to the screen while the world scrolls behind them.

TOP BAR — NOT A NAVBAR. FLOATING ICONS ONLY (CRITICAL):
- The top is NOT a navbar and contains NO text. The business/agency name MUST NOT appear at the top of the card — the name lives ONLY in the profile block inside the scrollable body.
